Blue Laser was added in '''Beta 6.6'''. Its first change happened in '''Beta 12.1''', where its ATK was buffed from 0 to 1. As a result, it will not die instantly from [http://undercards.wikia.com/wiki/Madjick Madjick]. [http://undercards.wikia.com/wiki/Orange_Laser Orange Laser] got the same change.

'''Beta 20.0''' changed Blue Laser up without changing up Orange Laser, though, by dropping its HP by 1 but leaving Orange Laser unchanged.

=== Stats ===
ATK:
* 0 (Post Beta 6.6)
* 1 (Post Beta 12.1, Current)
HP:
* 8 (Post Beta 6.6)
* 7 (Post Beta 20.0, Current)

Cost: 4

Ability: Deal 1 damage to an attacking enemy monster.

Rarity: White (Common)
